    "final_answer": "I have all the information needed. Let me provide the complete recipe.\n\n## Best Chocolate Chip Cookies\n*From Allrecipes.com — 4.6 stars, 19,465 ratings, 14,907 reviews*\n\n**Recipe Info:**\n- Prep Time: 20 minutes\n- Cook Time: 10 minutes\n- Total Time: 30 minutes\n- Yield: 4 dozen cookies (48 servings)\n\n### Ingredients\n- 1 cup butter, softened\n- 1 cup white sugar\n- 1 cup packed brown sugar\n- 2 large eggs\n- 2 teaspoons vanilla extract\n- 1 teaspoon baking soda\n- 2 teaspoons hot water\n- ½ teaspoon salt\n- 3 cups all-purpose flour\n- 2 cups semisweet chocolate chips\n- 1 cup chopped walnuts\n\n### Directions / Preparation Steps\n1. **Gather ingredients** — Make sure your butter is softened and your eggs are at room temperature.\n2. **Preheat the oven** to 350°F (175°C). Beat butter, white sugar, and brown sugar together in a large bowl with an electric mixer until smooth and creamy.\n3. **Beat in eggs**, one at a time, then stir in vanilla.\n4. **Dissolve baking soda** in hot water; add to the batter along with salt and mix until combined.\n5. **Stir in flour**, chocolate chips, and walnuts until a soft dough forms.\n6. **Drop rounded spoonfuls** of cookie dough 2 inches apart onto ungreased baking sheets.\n7. **Bake** in the preheated oven until edges are lightly browned, about 10 minutes.\n8. **Cool** on the baking sheets briefly before transferring to a wire rack to cool completely.\n9. **Store** in an airtight container, or serve immediately and enjoy!\n\n**Source:** https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/10813/best-chocolate-chip-cookies/\n\nThe task was completed successfully. I navigated to allrecipes.com, searched for chocolate chip cookies, and selected the most popular recipe (\"Best Chocolate Chip Cookies,\" with 19,465 ratings), then extracted the full ingredients list and the nine preparation steps.",
